WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Isn’t it the member who got on the bus and the member who got off?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Isn’t it necessary to increase the price?

3
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:09,410
What card is that of hers?

4
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:11,610
Why did it get brushed? What happened?

5
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:13,210
Didn’t you say you would save us players?

6
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:14,610
This battle is too much

7
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:16,410
It's not the original route at all. There's something wrong with this copy.

8
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:18,010
Is that woman also a player?

9
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:20,860
Is that woman a player or a ghost?

10
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,460
How can there be such a human-like ghost?

11
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:23,660
Must be a player

12
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,460
Her card must have more than four yuan

13
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,860
If you pay the fare

14
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:28,860
You can get your organs back, little girl

15
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:29,860
little girl

16
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:32,060
I'm calling you if you sleep by the window

17
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,460
You're deaf and didn't hear?

18
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,460
You damn girl

19
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:35,460
Don't pretend to be asleep

20
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:36,460
Hurry up

21
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:41,720
No loud noise is allowed in the car

22
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,320
This girl is in a good mood

23
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:45,180
Not affected by the outside world

24
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,980
I'll find a chance to chat with her later.

25
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,980
See if there is any chance to develop into a teammate

26
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:53,180
Nishui Lake Station has arrived

27
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:54,580
Passengers who want to get off please

28
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:57,760
Get off at the back door

29
00:00:57,760 --> 00:00:59,820
This is not a good thing

30
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:01,820
I won't cause you any trouble

31
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:03,420
I don't interfere with your choice

32
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:04,820
You have to bear the consequences yourself
